def main():
 z=read(P/'RESULTS_PUBLIC.json');p=verify();assert read(P/'ROOT_INDEPENDENT_AUDIT.json')['status']=='pass'
 put(P/'CONFIGURATION.json',{k:v for k,v in p.items()if k not in ['records','created_epoch','deadline_epoch']});put(P/'MODEL_PROVENANCE.json',read(ROOT/'results/stvg_error_state/2026-10-19/realizable_query_opd32/MODEL_PROVENANCE.json'))
 cost=dict(total_Source_captures_completed=0,final_worker_DINO_encodings_completed=0,engineering_DINO_encodings_completed=0,new_training_runs=0,new_heads=0,new_GPU_seconds=read(D/'GPU_COST_RECEIPT.json')['GPU_allocation_seconds'],actual_trajectory_decoder_calls=sum(r['compute']['actual_trajectory_decoder_calls']for r in z['rows']),actual_PosDecoder_calls=sum(r['compute']['actual_PosDecoder_calls']for r in z['rows']),OPD_fit_episodes=0,backward_calls=0,old_Source_E_DINO_cache_cost_excluded=True,not_first_online_latency=True);put(P/'COST_BREAKDOWN.json',cost)
 def ci(q):return 'unknown'if q['mean']is None else f"{q['mean']:+.6f} [{q['CI95'][0]:+.6f},{q['CI95'][1]:+.6f}]"
 lines=['# Persistent four-anchor reference conditioning32','', 'Original exposed NH16/NV16, one query per parent; not independent confirmation. Frozen cross-domain EMA TA-STVG, fixed E+finalMBR, original four cached DINO/E-selected anchors. No new expert/DINO call, Source capture, head/model training, pretrained parameter update or backward. This is a conditional teacher qualification, NOT an OPD score. Seven outputs and full per-layer actual reference/output traces for all32 sealed before NEW GT evaluation; all signed/unknown/no-reference/adverse cases retained.','', '## New intervention and matched controls','', 'TA-STVG has an absolute bbox head that overwrites reference boxes after each layer. Initial-only reseeding can therefore disappear. Here only the retained anchor positions are replaced just before sine/reference positional embedding in all six frozen layers; the matched control supplies E boxes at the identical positions and layers. Native content, memory, first-pass/routing, query time, learned heads and all unobserved reference updates remain unchanged. Self-attention operates within each offset; no claim of cross-offset propagation. Missing-anchor offsets must have identical DINO/E paths and exactly E readout.','', 'The primary background is box coordinates conditioning positional attention: [DAB-DETR official](https://github.com/IDEA-Research/DAB-DETR), [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.12329). Its training results or additive bbox-regression behavior are not imported. Current TA-STVG code defines the actual absolute-head intervention. Earlier raw initial-reference32, object-query aggregation and native-constant ClosureReplay derivative controls are different and remain documented; this is not a claim no prior reference interventions existed.','', 'Only two schedules prelocked, initial1 and all6, without intermediate-layer/strength search. For each schedule run DINO and E references, then read out z(E)+z(D_DINO)-z(D_E), z=(cx,cy,logw,logh). Same condition inputs give exactly E. This removes the common redecoding/reseeding response; it does not guarantee nonlinear causal additivity or correct target identity. Main Initial_delta/Persistent_delta/Persistent_shuffle keep all four planned actual nodes exactly E and change only unobserved nodes. Raw predicted boxes are not overwritten by DINO, so this is attention conditioning rather than forced final-anchor accuracy.','', 'Shuffle cyclically rotates the same retained DINO boxes at fixed positions; fewer than2 retained anchors is explicitly degenerate. Anchor_local directly replaces retained E nodes with their selected DINO boxes, a practical sparse control. Persistent_allnodes applies the same paired readout also to planned nodes as a prelocked sensitivity readout; it is excluded from the gate and cannot rescue a failed primary arm. No-reference queries keep every new method E, remain in the full16 domain denominator.','', '## Results','','| Output | HC complete vIoU % | Vid complete vIoU % | HC unobserved actual sIoU % | Vid unobserved actual sIoU % |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
 for a in p['arms']:lines.append('| '+a+' | '+' | '.join(f"{100*z['groups'][ds]['metrics'][a][ep]:.6f}"for ds,ep in [('hc2','v'),('vidstg','v'),('hc2','unobserved_actual_s'),('vidstg','unobserved_actual_s')])+' |')
 for ds,g in z['groups'].items():
  lines+=['',f'## {ds}: paired parent differences, pp','','| Contrast | Complete vIoU [95%CI] | Unobserved actual sIoU [95%CI] | v positive/negative/neutral | v below -5pp |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
  for c,t in g['paired'].items():
   v=t['v'];lines.append(f"| {c} | {ci(v)} | {ci(t['unobserved_actual_s'])} | {v['positive']}/{v['negative']}/{v['neutral']} | {v['severe_loss_below_minus5pp']} |")
 lines+=['','## Original qualification decision','',str(read(P/'DECISION.json')),'', 'Measured Persistent_delta minus E complete-v is HC-0.020310pp/Vid-0.003091pp, unobserved actual-s-0.047214/-0.003046pp; CIs cross0. Initial-only paired changes are nearly zero. Persistent_allnodes full-v is-0.084461/-0.043493pp, with HC CI strictly negative; it cannot replace the failed primary arm. Direct selected-anchor replacement yields+0.263624/+0.115594pp, with unobserved actual nodes exactly unchanged. These findings separate useful local evidence from an unsupported conditional propagation/readout.', '', 'The unchanged prelocked gate determines only whether this specific conditional teacher may enter a separately locked OPD test. It does not prove any OPD gain, even if qualified. If not qualified, retain every result and stop this exact schedule/readout interface without layer/blend/threshold search. Broader frozen conditioning and OPD are not universally disproved. An attention path existing or creating larger movements does not mean the transmitted information is correct.','', 'LAYER_RESPONSE_PUBLIC.json is no-GT arithmetic on saved layer outputs, reporting raw coordinate differences between the paired DINO/E paths by layer. It is not an accuracy measure or a basis for selecting an intermediate layer. Official interpolation is retained in full tube v; interpolated video frames are not additional independent supervision. Missing target annotations remain unknown. All temporal intervals and tIoU are identical.','', 'Root CPU audit checks actual prescribed reference-slot/schedule replacement, nonanchor own-path carry, actual no-injection all-six-layer native equality, raw final assembly, independent center/logsize paired readout, planned-node invariance, no-reference/missing-offset exactness, physical calls, independent official metrics and parent bootstraps. It does not rerun GPU decoder; frozen weights and input hashes plus saved physical execution receipts cover that boundary.','', 'Two fixed engineering pilot aliases checked exactness and response/time without GT. Per-pair time/resources checked before/after; modelhash/fullpins plus final guard precede32barrier. Exception cleanup independently attempts partial/cost persistence and always releases shared GPU lease. No signals to unrelated services.','', 'Incremental costs excluding old Source/E/expert/cache generation: '+str(cost),'', '## Every signed full-v change vs E, pp','','| Alias | Domain | Persistent | Initial | Shuffle | Anchor-local | All-nodes auxiliary |','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
 for r in z['rows']:lines.append('| '+r['alias']+' | '+r['dataset']+' | '+' | '.join(f"{100*(r['values'][a]['v']-r['values']['E_MBR']['v']):+.6f}"for a in ['Persistent_delta','Initial_delta','Persistent_shuffle','Anchor_local','Persistent_allnodes'])+' |')
 (P/'REPORT.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
 import matplotlib;matplotlib.use('Agg');import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
 fig,axs=plt.subplots(1,2,figsize=(10,4))
 for ax,ds in zip(axs,['hc2','vidstg']):
  for i,a in enumerate(['Initial_delta','Persistent_delta','Persistent_shuffle','Persistent_allnodes']):
   t=z['groups'][ds]['paired'][a+'_minus_E_MBR']['v'];m=t['mean'];lo,hi=t['CI95'];ax.errorbar(i,m,yerr=[[m-lo],[hi-m]],fmt='o',capsize=4)
  ax.axhline(0,color='k',lw=.7);ax.set_xticks(range(4),['Initial1','Persistent6','Shuffle','Allnodes(aux)']);ax.set(title=ds,ylabel='Complete vIoU change vs E (pp)')
 fig.tight_layout();fig.savefig(P/'COMPARISON.svg');fig.savefig(D/'COMPARISON.png',dpi=120);plt.close(fig)
 put(D/'PUBLIC_FILES_FINAL.json',dict(files=CODE+['scripts/audit_stvg_anchor_refresh32_v1.py','scripts/analyze_stvg_anchor_refresh32_v1.py','scripts/report_stvg_anchor_refresh32_v1.py']+[str(f.relative_to(ROOT))for f in P.iterdir()if f.is_file()]));put(D/'REPORT_COMPLETION.json',dict(status='complete',count=32))
